{
  "_": "The native libraries and assets QCView ships beside its own code (the Rust crates come from cargo-about). 'files' = the staged file names an entry accounts for (fnmatch); a shipped binary no entry names FAILS the package. 'version' may be 'pin:<file>:<KEY>'.",
