      "ffmpeg": true,
      "note": "Linked dynamically (libavcodec, libavformat, libavutil, libavfilter, libavdevice, libswscale, libswresample) and shipped as the ffmpeg / ffprobe command-line tools. Built from the FFmpeg sources with three local patches (tools/ffmpeg/patches in the source repository). macOS: built by tools/ffmpeg/build-macos.sh. Windows: the BtbN \"gpl-shared\" recipe, patched (tools/ffmpeg/build-win64-wsl.sh).",
